  "content": {
    "id": "p56-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "I eat $\\frac{2}{9}$ of a chocolate bar. My friend eats $\\frac{3}{7}$ of the bar.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p56-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Who ate more chocolate?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The friend.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{9}&=\\frac{14}{63}\\\\\\frac{3}{7}&=\\frac{27}{63}\\end{align*}$$Since $\\frac{27}{63}>\\frac{14}{63}$, the friend ate more chocolate.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p56-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "What fraction did we eat altogether?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{41}{63}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{3}{7}&=\\frac{14}{63}+\\frac{27}{63}\\\\&=\\frac{41}{63}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      },
      {
        "id": "p56-q7-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "What percentage of the bar did I eat?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$22.\\dot{2}\\%$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{9}\\times100\\%&=\\frac{200}{9}\\%\\\\&=22.\\dot{2}\\%\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p56-q7-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "Write the ratio of how much I ate to how much my friend ate in simplest form.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$14:27$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{9}:\\frac{3}{7}&=\\left(\\frac{2}{9}\\times63\\right):\\left(\\frac{3}{7}\\times63\\right)\\\\&=14:27\\end{align*}$$The parts have no common factor greater than $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      }
    ]
  },
